WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.663
I couldn’t wait to eat.

2
00:00:03.664 --> 00:00:08.754
I was so hungry!

3
00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:10.771
Waiter: Would you like anything else?

4
00:00:10.772 --> 00:00:12.531
Sunny: Just a minute, please.

5
00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:16.304
Hana and Bada, do you want anything else?

6
00:00:16.305 --> 00:00:21.564
Bada: I want the sweet thing with beef.

7
00:00:21.565 --> 00:00:23.175
Sunny: What is that?

8
00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:26.078
Hana: He means sweet and sour beef.

9
00:00:26.079 --> 00:00:27.856
Sunny: Oh, I see.

10
00:00:27.857 --> 00:00:32.194
Would you like that too, Hana? Hana:

11
00:00:32.195 --> 00:00:34.512
I don’t mind, Aunt Sunny. I

12
00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:36.313
am hungry. Sunny: Okay,

13
00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:43.439
okay. A dish of sweet and sour beef, please. Waiter:

14
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.997
Yes, ma’am. Would you like anything to drink? Sunny:

15
00:00:46.998 --> 00:00:49.233
Some cold water, please. Hana:

16
00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.195
May I have cold water too? Waiter:

17
00:00:52.196 --> 00:00:54.916
Sure. Tom:

18
00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:58.287
I would like a glass of house wine, please. Waiter:

19
00:00:58.288 --> 00:01:02.408
Yes, sir. Bada:

20
00:01:02.408 --> 00:01:07.555
Mom, may I have a Coke, please? Mom:

21
00:01:07.556 --> 00:01:10.987
Alright, Bada. Just this one time.

22
00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:14.700
Bada: Yes! I would like a Coke, please.

23
00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:18.403
Waiter: Right away!

24
00:01:18.404 --> 00:01:20.954
Bada loves soft drinks.

25
00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:29.932
They're not good for your teeth, you know!

